//shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866300/extras/b294bf24b5ae26dac0494aed7806521b.mp4?t=1774265434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostile environments demand resilience. Defend your colony against relentless environmental threats and mysterious alien forces while balancing the needs of your settlers. Strategic planning and adaptability are key to ensuring survival.</p>",
